  shortName: Tube 5
  category: Depot tube
  when: "Sol 668  \xB7  Jan 6, 2023"
  activity: Perseverance set sample tube 5 of 10 down here while building the Three Forks depot, a backup set of samples for a future Mars Sample Return mission.
  subtitle: Sample tube left at the Three Forks depot
  details: "Dropped on sol 668 (5 of 10)  \xB7  photographed sol 668 (2023-01-06)\nPosition: where the rover parked to drop it (about 1-2 m)"
  photos:
