  displayName: Depot tube 2
  shortName: Tube 2
  category: Depot tube
  when: "Sol 655  \xB7  Dec 23, 2022"
  activity: Perseverance set sample tube 2 of 10 down here while building the Three Forks depot, a backup set of samples for a future Mars Sample Return mission.
  subtitle: Sample tube left at the Three Forks depot
  details: "Dropped on sol 655 (2 of 10)  \xB7  photographed sol 655 (2022-12-23)\nPosition: where the rover parked to drop it (about 1-2 m)"
