  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: b5734988fcc58434ca296f801b734a1e, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground after the rover backed away
    credit: "Front Hazcam  \xB7  Sol 658  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech"
