  displayName: Depot tube 1
  shortName: Tube 1
  category: Depot tube
  when: "Sol 653  \xB7  Dec 21, 2022"
  activity: Perseverance set sample tube 1 of 10 down here while building the Three Forks depot, a backup set of samples for a future Mars Sample Return mission.
  subtitle: Sample tube left at the Three Forks depot
  details: "Dropped on sol 653 (1 of 10)  \xB7  photographed sol 653 (2022-12-21)\nPosition: where the rover parked to drop it (about 1-2 m)"
  photos:
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 87bed54ccc79777498b20eccc5f2fb55, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground under the rover, just after the drop
    credit: "WATSON  \xB7  Sol 653  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech/MSSS"
  - image: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 4a7ecc8bdc6fdf14596f485f3035e6a1, type: 3}
    caption: The tube on the ground after the rover backed away
    credit: "Front Hazcam  \xB7  Sol 654  \xB7  NASA/JPL-Caltech"
  placeByLonLat: 1
  longitude: 77.407756
  latitude: 18.452627
  revealRadius: 4
